Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): serialize historical titles in both recovery
 producers [daveey]

Problem: common model-neutral validation rejected continuation recovery for legacy named-review titles. Earlier no-progress repair missed the continuation and goal siblings. Preserve source titles via existing standalone inert-evidence serialization rather than weakening ingress. Proof: unchanged independent probe RED 1/1; focused final importing/facade consumers 110/0 across nine files, retries OFF; other focused recovery/validator consumers green; full scripts/check green. Goal fixture refreshes authentic snapshot after historical seed, preserving judge custody. Explicit-class all-provider preclaim issue remains tracked by original owner; no live fleet remediation or quota changes claimed.
